{
  "decision": "REVISE",
  "detail": {
    "days": 14,
    "checkpoint": "You finish the 30-minute diagnostic set of five changed circuits, record which method you chose for each and why, and we compare your answers and reasons against the actual circuit topologies. That comparison is the real evidence about whether your claimed mastery holds; the claim alone does not certify anything."
  },
