            "Repair is contingent rather than booked, so a learner who is actually correct is not given unnecessary work; the cost is that the total effort is not known until the diagnostic is compared.",
            "Because no course syllabus or taught-method list was supplied, the diagnostic uses standard beginner circuit methods and asks the learner to flag anything never taught rather than assume advanced methods."
